# Brightline canonical domain — `.com` only

Production site: **`https://brightlinephotography.com`** (`lib/truth/brand-lock.ts`).

## Hard rules

- **Never** use `brightlinephotography.co` in URLs, env vars, emails, or docs for the live site.
- Use `CANONICAL_SITE_ORIGIN`, `CANONICAL_SITE_DOMAIN`, `CANONICAL_MEDIA_ORIGIN`, `CANONICAL_IMAGES_HOST` from `lib/truth/brand-lock.ts`.
- Legacy `.co` is **redirect-only** (`vercel.json`) and tenant hostname alias (`LEGACY_BRIGHTLINE_SITE_DOMAIN`) — not canonical.

## Allowed `.co` references (only)

- `vercel.json` / root `vercel.json` redirect rules
- `LEGACY_BRIGHTLINE_*` constants and `isLegacyBrightlineCoHost()` for reading old stored URLs
- `lib/platform/tenants/registry.ts` alias map
- Resolver tests and deploy docs that document redirects

## Guard

`lib/truth/canonical-domain.test.ts` scans the repo and fails CI if `.co` appears outside the allowlist.
